            "review_title": "Review at 4An Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Amanda_The_Pixie\nPretoria, South Africa333 contributions\n0\nAmazing Vegetarian Gem in City\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nSuch an incredible little place! I'm so glad that we stumbled upon this gem while wandering the streets of Ho Chi Minh.\nThe staff are wonderfully friendly, the food incredibly delicious and the portions are so generous! We visited a few times during our short stay HCMC. I only wish that there more branches in the rest of the country to visit.\n\nIf you're ever in the city, and would like an amazing traditional Vietnamese vegetarian meal, this is definitely the place to visit. \nI highly recommend it, even if you are not strictly vegetarian at all, this food is still so good that it is well worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2020",
