            "review_text": "Meg K\n3 contributions\n0\nTHE ABSOLUTE BEST IN HO CHI MINH!!\nJan 2020 • Family\nI visited this restaurant as a vegetarian but wasn’t expecting much. The food here though, was outstanding and I absolutely loved it. The staff were very friendly and the prices are very good. There are 2 sizes to choose from for each dish so it’s easy to sample many varieties. This food was delicious and I would come back to Vietnam just to go to this restaurant!! So yummy 😋 !\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2020",
